// BT-4298 (ADR 0142 §1, rule 2): a stateless subclass of a stateful class.
// An inherited class method that touches the parent's class variables
// raises `undeclared_class_variable` when sent here (class variables are
// own-only, ADR 0130), and ADR 0142 must not change that error.

GuardedDiffClassStateful subclass: GuardedDiffClassForgot
